      <h1>Top 10 Types of Leather Pants Manufacturers in China: A Buyer's Guide to Choosing the Right Factory</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-16">October 16, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/top-10-leather-pants-manufacturers-in-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Sourcing leather pants from China involves a chain of linked decisions: which material, which factory tier, which MOQ, which lead time, which compliance paperwork. Break one link and you either overpay badly on a 150-piece trial or sit on a 40-foot container of pants that never sells through</p>
